OL,3,GNEWSARAF base prepares for threats at
OL,4,Ahome and abroad
OL,5,
OL,6,FA front-line RAF base has expanded
OL,7,Ftraining for all personnel to reflect
OL,8,Fevolving threats at home and abroad.
OL,10,FRAF Coningsby, in Lincolnshire, is one
OL,11,Fof two quick reaction alert stations
OL,12,Fthat protect UK airspace with
OL,13,Fcombat-ready squadrons of Typhoon jets.
OL,15,FMilitary leaders have raised the level
OL,16,Fof force protection training, which
OL,17,Fincludes combat first aid, additional
OL,18,Ffirearms drills and awareness of
OL,19,Fchemical, nuclear and biological
OL,20,Fhazards.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
