OL,3,GNEWSARAF base prepares for threats at
OL,4,Ahome and abroad
OL,5,
OL,6,FWing Cdr Ian Hart, who commands 29
OL,7,FSquadron, said the change in posture
OL,8,Fwas "a recognition that the threat can
OL,9,Fcome to us very, very easily in today's
OL,10,Fworld".
